conversion.1	1	conversion	sheets					a file whose name ends .mtsv is read by the parser
conversion.2	1	conversion	sheets					a file whose extension names a format is read by that format's module: .csv by csv
conversion.3	1	conversion	sheets					what a file holds that MTSV does not is left behind, each thing named as its format's module names it, in order
conversion.4	1	conversion	sheets	no format				a file whose extension names no format ends its conversion as no format
